<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLISH COUNTY CHAMPIONSHIP CLOSE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the second</p>
<p>day of four day English county championships matches on Friday:</p>
<p>At Ilford: Essex 297 (R.J.Rollins 60, D.Gough 5-74) &amp; 215-4</p>
<p>(S.G.Law 76) v Yorkshire 334 (M.P.Vaughan 161, R.J.Blakey 92,</p>
<p>P.M.Such 6-121).</p>
<p>At Cardiff: Glamorgan 597-8 declared (S.P.James 153, H.Morris</p>
<p>135, M.P.Maynard 134 not out, A.Dale 73) v Durham 230-6</p>
<p>(M.J.Foster 66 not out, D.C.Boon 66).</p>
<p>At Southampton: Warwickshire 631-7 declared (A.J.Moles 168,</p>
<p>D.L.Hemp 138, T.L.Penney 86 not out, N.V.Knight 81, G.Welch 75)</p>
<p>v Hampshire 172-3 (M.L.Hayden 81 not out).</p>
<p>At Leicester: Lancashire 373 (G.D.Lloyd 82, G.Chapple 63,</p>
<p>W.K.Hegg 58, A.D.Mullally 5-79) v Leicestershire 380-5</p>
<p>(N.C.Johnson 134 not out, V.J.Wells 95, P.A.Nixon 68 not out).</p>
<p>At Lord's: Middlesex 531 (J.H.Kallis 121, M.R.Ramprakash 111,</p>
<p>M.W.Gatting 108, K.R.Brown 61 not out, J.P.Taylor 4-99) v</p>
<p>Northamptonshire 165-4 (K.M.Curran 57 not out).</p>
<p>At Nottingham (Trent Bridge): Nottinghamshire 216 (U.Afzaal 54,</p>
<p>M.V.Fleming 5-51) v Kent 376-8 (M.A.Ealham 100 not out,</p>
<p>D.P.Fulton 94, P.A.Strang 51 not out).</p>
<p>At Worcester: Worcestershire 303 (T.S.Curtis 101, G.R.Haynes</p>
<p>70, A.R.Caddick 5-64) v Somerset 256-8 (P.C.L Holloway 61,</p>
<p>D.A.Leatherdale 4-34).</p>
</text>
